<title>CHINA: Trading of Righteous shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Righteous shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of leather goods retailer Righteous (Holdings) Ltd was suspended on Monday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares closed the morning session HK$0.105 higher at HK$0.51.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
